# Monthly wiki-log files are append-only, one line per entry. The union merge
# driver keeps both sides' appended lines instead of conflicting, so parallel
# agents can each add an entry without a merge conflict. This is only safe
# because entries are single lines — the `wiki-log-format` pre-commit hook
# enforces that. See doc/log.md.
doc/log/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].md merge=union
